    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking questions formally",
     "texto": [
      "The question changes the ending: **-ㅂ니까? / -습니까?**",
      "학생**입니까?** = Are you a student? 질문이 **있습니까?** = Are there any questions?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal expressions",
     "texto": [
      "**안녕하십니까?** = hello (very formal). **처음 뵙겠습니다** = pleased to meet you, when meeting someone. **죄송합니다** = I'm sorry, excuse me. **알겠습니다** = understood."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
